,"Add to cart button":["加入購物車按鈕"],"Visit our store":["歡迎光臨我們的門店"],"Main Street 12, Springfield":["Main Street 12, Springfield"],"Mon–Fri 9:00–18:00, Sat 9:00–13:00":["週一至週五 9:00–18:00，週六 9:00–13:00"],"Get directions":["獲取路線"],"Place":["地點"],"Map":["地圖"],"Google Maps":["Google Maps"],"OpenStreetMap":["OpenStreetMap"],"Address":["地址"],"E.g. \"Main Street 12, Springfield\". Or leave it empty and enter the coordinates.":["例如「Main Street 12, Springfield」。也可以留空並輸入坐標。"],"Latitude":["緯度"],"OpenStreetMap needs the coordinates, e.g. 50.0815. Find them by a right-click on the place in openstreetmap.org (\"Show address\").":["OpenStreetMap 需要坐標，例如 50.0815。在 openstreetmap.org 上右鍵單擊該地點（「顯示地址」）即可找到。"],"Optional, more precise than the address.":["可選，比地址更精確。"],"Longitude":["經度"],"Map type":["地圖類型"],"Satellite":["衛星"],"Google Maps API key (optional)":["Google Maps API 金鑰（可選）"],"The map works without a key. With a key of the Maps Embed API (free in the Google Cloud console) it uses the official embed.":["地圖無需金鑰即可使用。使用 Maps Embed API 的金鑰（在 Google Cloud 控制台中免費獲取）時，將使用官方嵌入方式。"],"Height":["高度"],"In pixels":["以像素為單位"],"Part of the screen height":["螢幕高度的比例"],"Height (% of the screen)":["高度（螢幕的 %）"],"Height (px)":["高度（px）"],"Black and white map":["黑白地圖"],"Visitors can move and zoom the map":["訪客可以移動和縮放地圖"],"Off: the map is only a picture in the background.":["關閉：地圖僅作為背景圖片。"],"Content on the map":["地圖上的內容"],"In a card":["在卡片中"],"Horizontal position":["水平位置"],"Vertical position":["垂直位置"],"Top":["頂部"],"Middle":["中間"],"Bottom":["底部"],"Width (px)":["寬度（px）"],"Under the map on phones":["手機上顯示在地圖下方"],"Privacy":["隱私"],"Load the map only after a click":["僅在點選後載入地圖"],"The map service (and its cookies) loads only when the visitor clicks the button; the choice is remembered in the browser.":["地圖服務（及其 Cookie）僅在訪客點選按鈕後載入；該選擇會紀錄在瀏覽器中。"],"Show the map":["顯示地圖"],"Text above the button":["按鈕上方的文字"],"The map is loaded from OpenStreetMap.":["地圖從 OpenStreetMap 載入。"],"The map is loaded from Google Maps, which may store cookies.":["地圖從 Google Maps 載入，可能會存儲 Cookie。"],"Color over the map":["地圖上的顏色"],"Enter the latitude and longitude of the place in the block settings.":["請在區塊設定中輸入該地點的緯度和經度。"],"Enter the address (or the coordinates) of the place in the block settings.":["請在區塊設定中輸入該地點的地址（或坐標）。"],"Add message":["新增消息"],"Behaviour":["行為"],"Show the messages":["顯示消息"],"One at a time, taking turns":["一次一條，輪流顯示"],"Scrolling ticker (marquee)":["捲動字幕（跑馬燈）"],"All side by side":["全部並排"],"Nothing moves for visitors who turned on \"reduce motion\", and the bar stops while the pointer or the keyboard is in it.":["對於開啟「減少動態效果」的訪客，內容不會移動；當滑鼠指針或鍵盤焦點在欄中時，欄會停止。"],"Seconds per message":["每條消息的秒數"],"Show arrows":["顯示箭頭"],"Speed (pixels per second)":["速度（每秒像素）"],"Visitors can close the bar":["訪客可以關閉此欄"],"Keep it closed for (days)":["保持關閉（天）"],"0 = until the browser tab is closed. Changing the messages shows the bar again.":["0 = 直到關閉瀏覽器標籤頁。更改消息後會再次顯示此欄。"],"Counts down to":["倒計時至"],"End":["結束"],"A date and time":["日期和時間"],"A time every day":["每天的某個時間"],"Ends at":["結束於"],"In the time zone of the site (Settings > General). Every visitor sees the same end.":["使用網站的時區（設定 > 常規）。每位訪客看到的結束時間相同。"],"Every day at":["每天於"],"For example the cut-off time for same-day shipping. In the time zone of the site.":["例如當日發貨的截止時間。使用網站的時區。"],"On these days":["在這些日子"],"After the time and on other days":["該時間之後及其他日子"],"Count down to the next chosen day":["倒計時到下一個所選日子"],"Hide until the next chosen day":["隱藏到下一個所選日子"],"When it ends":["結束時"],"Hide the block":["隱藏區塊"],"Show a text":["顯示文字"],"Text when it ends":["結束時的文字"],"This offer has ended.":["此優惠已結束。"],"Text above (optional)":["上方文字（可選）"],"Sale ends in":["促銷結束倒計時"],"Numbers in boxes":["方框中的數字"],"Plain numbers":["純數字"],"Show days":["顯示天數"],"Off: the hours go above 24.":["關閉：小時數會超過 24。"],"Show seconds":["顯示秒數"],"Show labels":["顯示標籤"],"Numbers":["數字"],"Boxes":["方框"],"Labels":["標籤"],"Week":["週"],"For example 9:00-17:00, or 9:00-12:00, 13:00-18:00 with a lunch break. Leave empty for closed. A time after midnight (18:00-2:00) belongs to the day it starts.":["例如 9:00-17:00，或含午休的 9:00-12:00, 13:00-18:00。留空表示休息。跨午夜的時間（18:00-2:00）屬於開始的那一天。"],"Closed":["休息"],"Special days":["特殊日子"],"Holidays and other days":["節假日和其他日子"],"One per line: 2026-12-24 = 9:00-12:00 | Christmas Eve, or 12-25 = (closed every year). The note after | is optional.":["每行一個：2026-12-24 = 9:00-12:00 | 平安夜，或 12-25 =（每年休息）。| 後面的備注為可選。"],"List the special days of the next 30 days":["列出未來 30 天內的特殊日子"],"Opening hours":["營業時間"],"Show \"Open now / Closed\"":["顯示「營業中 / 已打烊」"],"Worked out in the visitor's browser in the time zone of the site, so it is right on cached pages too.":["在訪客瀏覽器中按網站時區計算，因此在快取頁面上也是正確的。"],"Show the week":["顯示一週"],"Highlight today":["突出顯示今天"],"Join days with the same hours":["合並營業時間相同的日子"],"Monday – Friday instead of five rows.":["顯示「週一 – 週五」，而不是五行。"],"Text for closed days":["休息日的文字"],"Box with a border":["帶邊框的框"],"Open":["營業中"],"Today":["今天"],"Stock":["庫存"],"Stock of":["庫存對象"],"Only the real stock is shown: the product (or variation) needs \"Manage stock?\" turned on in WooCommerce.":["僅顯示真實庫存：產品（或變體）需要在 WooCommerce 中開啟「管理庫存？」。"],"Show \"Only … left\" at this stock or less":["庫存不高於此數時顯示「僅剩 …」"],"The bar is full at":["庫存達到此數時條形為滿"],"Stock at or above this number fills the bar.":["庫存達到或高於此數時條形填滿。"],"Show \"In stock\" above that number":["高於該數時顯示「有貨」"],"Show \"Out of stock\" and backorders":["顯示「缺貨」和預訂"],"Leave empty for the default text. {stock} is the number in stock.":["留空則使用預設文字。{stock} 為庫存數量。"],"Low stock":["庫存不足"],"Only {stock} left in stock":["僅剩 {stock} 件"],"In stock":["有貨"],"Out of stock":["缺貨"],"On backorder":["可預訂"],"Available on backorder":["可預訂"],"Show the bar":["顯示條形"],"Show the colored dot":["顯示彩色圓點"],"Bar":["條形"],"Bar background":["條形背景"],"Lowest price":["最低價格"],"Price of":["價格："],"The lowest price comes from the price history that Envo Blocks keeps for every product. Defaults: Envo Blocks > Lowest Price.":["最低價格來自 Envo Blocks 為每個產品儲存的價格歷史。預設值：Envo Blocks > 最低價格。"],"Number of days (0 = the setting)":["天數（0 = 使用設定）"],"The EU rule is 30 days.":["歐盟規定為 30 天。"],"Show it":["顯示"],"As in the setting":["與設定相同"],"Only for products on sale":["僅限促銷產品"],"For every product":["所有產品"],"{days} is the number of days, {price} the lowest price. Leave empty for the text of the setting.":["{days} 為天數，{price} 為最低價格。留空則使用設定中的文字。"],"Lowest price in the last {days} days: {price}":["最近 {days} 天最低價格：{price}"],"With a background":["帶背景"],"Attribute (color, size …)":["屬性（顏色、尺碼 …）"],"Category":["分類"],"Stock status":["庫存狀態"],"On sale":["促銷"],"Brand":["品牌"],"Check boxes":["核取方塊"],"Links":["連結"],"Buttons":["按鈕"],"Dropdown":["下拉清單"],"Swatches (colors, images)":["色板（顏色、圖片）"],"Filter":["篩選"],"Filters the products of the shop, the categories and the product search (classic shop or the Product Collection block). On other pages the options link to the shop.":["篩選商店、分類和產品搜尋中的產品（經典商店或 Product Collection 區塊）。在其他頁面上，選項會連結到商店。"],"Filter by":["篩選依據"],"Attribute":["屬性"],"The first attribute":["第一個屬性"],"More values":["多個值"],"Products with any of them":["包含任一項的產品"],"Products with all of them":["包含全部的產品"],"Levels of subcategories":["子分類層級"],"On a category page the filter lists its subcategories.":["在分類頁面上，篩選器會列出其子分類。"],"Step of the slider":["滑桿步長"],"Leave empty for the name of the filter.":["留空則使用篩選器名稱。"],"Hide the title":["隱藏標題"],"Collapsible":["可折疊"],"Yes, open":["是，展開"],"Yes, closed":["是，收起"],"Show the number of products":["顯示產品數量"],"Options before \"Show more\" (0 = all)":["「顯示更多」之前的選項數（0 = 全部）"],"Hide options without products":["隱藏沒有產品的選項"],"Otherwise they are greyed out. Options that no product of the page has are never shown.":["否則以灰色顯示。頁面中沒有任何產品具備的選項永遠不會顯示。"],"Envo Blocks PRO filters without reloading the page and adds brands, \"On sale\", swatches, buttons, dropdowns and a filter drawer for phones.":["Envo Blocks PRO 無需重新載入頁面即可篩選，並新增品牌、「促銷中」、色板、按鈕、下拉清單以及手機端篩選抽屜。"],"Active filters":["已選篩選"],"Shown only while a filter is on. The preview shows a sample.":["僅在啟用篩選時顯示。預覽中顯示示例。"],"Show \"Clear all\"":["顯示「全部清除」"],"Track your order":["追蹤您的訂單"],"Enter your order number and the email address you used at checkout. The order number is in the confirmation email.":["請輸入您的訂單號和結帳時使用的電子郵件地址。訂單號在確認郵件中。"],"The form is the WooCommerce order tracking: after a search the order and its updates appear in the same place.":["該表單是 WooCommerce 的訂單追蹤：搜尋後，訂單及其更新會顯示在同一位置。"],"Free shipping":["免運費"],"Amount for free shipping":["免運費金額"],"From WooCommerce \"Free shipping\" methods":["來自 WooCommerce 的「免運費」方式"],"Set here":["在此設定"],"Automatic uses the lowest minimum order amount of the Free shipping methods in your shipping zones.":["自動使用您配送區域中「免運費」方式的最低訂單金額。"],"Amount (in the shop currency)":["金額（商店貨幣）"],"Hide when free shipping is reached":["達到免運費後隱藏"],"Use {remaining} for the missing amount and {threshold} for the free shipping amount. Leave empty for the default text.":["使用 {remaining} 表示差額，使用 {threshold} 表示免運費金額。留空則使用預設文字。"],"While the amount is not reached":["未達到金額時"],"Add {remaining} more to get free shipping!":["再買 {remaining} 即可享受免運費！"],"When it is reached":["達到金額時"],"You have free shipping!":["您已享受免運費！"],"When the cart is empty":["購物車為空時"],"Free shipping on orders over {threshold}.":["訂單滿 {threshold} 免運費。"],"Text alignment":["文字對齊"],"Show progress bar":["顯示進度條"],"Bar when reached":["達到時的條形"],"Round heart":["圓形愛心"],"Bookmark":["書籤"],"The wishlist page could not be created.":["無法建立願望清單頁面。"],"Wishlist page:":["願望清單頁面："],"Edit":["編輯"],"No wishlist page is set yet: this page becomes the wishlist page when it is published.":["尚未設定願望清單頁面：此頁面發布後將成為願望清單頁面。"],"You have no wishlist page yet. The \"View\" link after saving a product leads there.":["您還沒有願望清單頁面。儲存產品後的「查看」連結會指向那裡。"],"Create the wishlist page":["建立願望清單頁面"],"Set it in WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced":["在 WooCommerce > 設定 > 高級 中設定"],"Wishlist button":["願望清單按鈕"],"On the product page and in a product template (Product Collection) the button uses that product. Choose a product only to place the button somewhere else.":["在產品頁面和產品範本（Product Collection）中，按鈕使用該產品。僅在要將按鈕放在其他位置時才選擇產品。"],"Button with an icon and text":["帶圖示和文字的按鈕"],"Round icon":["圓形圖示"],"Icon and text (link style)":["圖示和文字（連結樣式）"],"Add to wishlist":["加入願望清單"],"Text when saved":["儲存後的文字"],"In your wishlist":["已在願望清單中"],"Icon and text":["圖示和文字"],"Icon when saved":["儲存後的圖示"],"Wishlist":["願望清單"],"The preview shows a few products of the shop; visitors see their own saved products.":["預覽顯示商店的幾件產品；訪客看到的是自己儲存的產品。"],"Grid of cards":["卡片網格"],"List (rows)":["清單（行）"],"Up to 3 on tablets, 2 on phones.":["平板最多 3 個，手機最多 2 個。"],"Products with options get a link to the product page.":["帶選項的產品會顯示指向產品頁面的連結。"],"Remove from the wishlist after adding to the cart":["加入購物車後從願望清單中移除"],"A share link, \"Add all to cart\", hearts on product images and a header icon with a drawer are in Envo Blocks PRO.":["分享連結、「全部加入購物車」、產品圖片上的愛心以及帶抽屜的頁首圖示位於 Envo Blocks PRO 中。"],"Empty wishlist":["空願望清單"],"Your wishlist is empty":["您的願望清單是空的"],"Tap the heart on any product to save it for later.":["點選任意產品上的愛心即可儲存以備後用。"],"The button leads to the shop.":["按鈕指向商店。"],"Continue shopping":["繼續購物"],"As in Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code":["與 Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 中相同"],"Payment":["付款"],"QR code format":["QR 碼格式"],"Automatic: QR Platba for CZK, EPC QR for EUR":["自動：CZK 使用 QR Platba，EUR 使用 EPC QR"],"Only QR Platba (CZK)":["僅 QR Platba（CZK）"],"Only EPC QR (EUR)":["僅 EPC QR（EUR）"],"Orders in other currencies get no code.":["其他貨幣的訂單不生成QR 碼。"],"Account":["帳戶"],"The accounts with an IBAN from WooCommerce > Settings > Payments > Direct bank transfer.":["來自 WooCommerce > 設定 > 付款 > 直接銀行轉帳 中帶 IBAN 的帳戶。"],"Payment message":["付款附言"],"Placeholders: {order_number}, {order_id}, {site_title}. Empty = as in Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code.":["預留位置：{order_number}、{order_id}、{site_title}。留空 = 與 Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 中相同。"],"Put the block in the Order Confirmation template. It shows only for orders paid by direct bank transfer that wait for the payment.":["將此區塊放入訂單確認範本中。僅對通過直接銀行轉帳付款且等待付款的訂單顯示。"],"Pay by QR code":["掃碼付款"],"Scan the code with the app of your bank: the account, amount and reference are filled in.":["用您銀行的應用掃描此碼：帳戶、金額和參考號會自動填寫。"],"Payment details":["付款詳情"],"Account, amount, variable symbol and message for entering the payment by hand.":["用於手動填寫付款的帳戶、金額、可變符號和附言。"],"Code beside the details":["QR 碼在詳情旁邊"],"Code above the details":["QR 碼在詳情上方"],"QR code size (px)":["QR 碼大小（px）"],"Empty = the document name and number, e.g. \"Invoice 202600012 (PDF)\".":["留空 = 文件名稱和編號，例如「發票 202600012（PDF）」。"],"Credit notes too":["也包括折讓單"],"Put the block in the Order Confirmation template. It shows when the invoice of the order is issued (Envo Blocks > Invoices).":["將此區塊放入訂單確認範本中。當訂單的發票開具後顯示（Envo Blocks > 發票）。"],"Additional information":["附加資訊"],"Reviews ({count})":["評價（{count}）"],"Own content (blocks)":["自定義內容（區塊）"],"The product's own tabs":["產品自身的分頁"],"Tabs of other plugins":["其他外掛的分頁"],"Content of the tab: text, images, a table, any blocks…":["分頁的內容：文字、圖片、表格、任意區塊…"],"Tab":["分頁"],"New tab":["新分頁"],"Tabs":["分頁"],"Every tab is a Product Tab block: click a tab to edit it, move it with the arrows of its toolbar or in the List View, add one with the + button. Tabs without content for a product (no description, no attributes, reviews off) are left out.":["每個分頁都是一個 Product Tab 區塊：點選分頁進行編輯，使用其工具欄中的箭頭或在清單檢視中移動它，用 + 按鈕新增新分頁。對某個產品沒有內容的分頁（沒有描述、沒有屬性、評價已關閉）會被省略。"],"Tabs of":["分頁對象"],"Headings inside the panels":["面板內的標題"],"The \"Description\" and \"Additional information\" headings WooCommerce prints above the text.":["WooCommerce 在文字上方顯示的「描述」和「附加資訊」標題。"],"Show as":["顯示為"],"Accordion":["手風琴"],"Tabs position":["分頁位置"],"Boxed":["帶框"],"Pills":["膠囊"],"Text only":["僅文字"],"Tabs alignment":["分頁對齊"],"Full width":["全寬"],"Width of the tabs column (px)":["分頁列的寬度（px）"],"Accordion on phones":["手機上使用手風琴"],"Below 782 px the tabs turn into an accordion.":["低於 782 px 時分頁變為手風琴。"],"First item open":["預設展開第一項"],"More items open at once":["可同時展開多項"],"The editor shows the items as tabs; the page shows the accordion.":["編輯器以分頁顯示各項；頁面上顯示為手風琴。"],"Space around the content (px)":["內容週圍的間距（px）"],"Tab text":["分頁文字"],"Active tab text":["活動分頁的文字"],"Accent (line, active pill)":["强調色（線條、活動膠囊）"],"Tab background":["分頁背景"],"Active tab background":["活動分頁的背景"],"Lines and borders":["線條和邊框"],"Content background":["內容背景"],"Content text":["內容文字"],"Adds its tabs only when the product has them.":["僅在產品有這些分頁時才新增。"],"Add tab":["新增分頁"],"Dimensions":["尺寸"],"Color":["顏色"],"Black, White":["黑色、白色"],"The reviews of the product and the form for a new review.":["產品的評價以及發表新評價的表單。"],"The tabs of the product (Products > Edit > Product data > Tabs), each as its own tab, here in the order. Nothing when the product has none.":["產品的分頁（產品 > 編輯 > 產品資料 > 分頁），每個作為單獨的分頁，按此處順序顯示。產品沒有時不顯示。"],"Tabs that other plugins add to WooCommerce products (e.g. vendor info, FAQ, size charts), each as its own tab. Nothing when there are none.":["其他外掛新增到 WooCommerce 產品的分頁（例如賣家資訊、常見問題、尺碼表），每個作為單獨的分頁。沒有時不顯示。"],"The description of the product (its main text) is shown here.":["此處顯示產品的描述（其主要文字）。"],"filled on the product page":["在產品頁面上填充"],"{count} is the number of reviews.":["{count} 為評價數量。"],"e.g. Shipping & returns":["例如 配送與退貨"],"Only for products in these categories":["僅限這些分類中的產品"],"Empty = every product.":["留空 = 所有產品。"],"How long does delivery take?":["配送需要多長時間？"],"Orders placed by 2 pm on a working day leave the same day. Delivery usually takes 1–3 working days.":["工作日 14:00 前下單當天發貨。配送通常需要 1–3 個工作日。"],"Can I return a product?":["可以退貨嗎？"],"Yes, within 30 days of delivery. Unused products in their original packaging get a full refund.":["可以，收貨後 30 天內均可退貨。未使用且包裝完好的商品全額退款。"],"Which payment methods do you accept?":["支援哪些付款方式？"],"Cards, Apple Pay and Google Pay, bank transfer and cash on delivery.":["銀行卡、Apple Pay 和 Google Pay、銀行轉帳以及貨到付款。"],"The answer: text, a list, an image, a button…":["回答：文字、清單、圖片、按鈕…"],"Questions":["問題"],"Every question is a FAQ Item block: type the question, the answer below it is made of blocks. Add a question with the + button, move it with the arrows of its toolbar. The editor shows all answers; the page shows them when a question is clicked.":["每個問題都是一個「FAQ 條目」區塊：輸入問題，下方的回答由區塊組成。用 + 按鈕新增問題，用其工具欄中的箭頭移動。編輯器顯示所有回答；頁面在點選問題時顯示。"],"First question open":["第一個問題展開"],"More questions open at once":["可同時展開多個問題"],"Off: opening a question closes the open one.":["關閉：展開一個問題會收起已展開的問題。"],"Question as":["問題標題級別"],"Heading 2":["標題 2"],"Heading 3":["標題 3"],"Heading 4":["標題 4"],"For the outline of the page; the look stays the same.":["用於頁面大綱；外觀保持不變。"],"FAQ data for search engines":["搜尋引擎 FAQ 資料"],"Adds schema.org FAQPage data (JSON-LD) with the questions and answers to the page. Turn it off when an SEO plugin already adds FAQ data for this page.":["向頁面新增含問題和回答的 schema.org FAQPage 資料（JSON-LD）。如果 SEO 外掛已為此頁面新增 FAQ 資料，請關閉。"],"Cards":["卡片"],"One box":["單個方框"],"Lines":["線條"],"Plus / minus":["加號 / 減號"],"Arrow":["箭頭"],"Space between questions (px)":["問題間距（px）"],"Inner space (px)":["內距（px）"],"Question text":["問題文字"],"Background of the open question":["展開問題的背景"],"Answer text":["回答文字"],"FAQ Item":["FAQ 條目"],"Question":["問題"],"Open when the page loads":["頁面載入時展開"],"Question…":["問題…"],"Customers ask on the product page; you answer in Envo Blocks › Settings › Product Questions. Only answered questions are shown.":["顧客在商品頁面提問；您在「Envo Blocks › 設定 › 商品問答」中回答。只顯示已回答的問題。"],"Questions of":["問題來源"],"Questions & answers":["問答"],"Questions before \"Show more\"":["「顯示更多」前的問題數"],"Search field":["搜尋框"],"From 4 answered questions.":["已回答問題達到 4 個時顯示。"],"\"Ask a question\" form":["「提問」表單"],"Accent (Q / A, buttons)":["强調色（Q / A、按鈕）"],"Loading…":["正在載入…"],"Other form (shortcode)":["其他表單（短代碼）"],"No supported form plugin is active. Install Contact Form 7, WPForms, Fluent Forms, Ninja Forms, Formidable Forms, Forminator or Gravity Forms, or paste the shortcode of another form.":["沒有啟用受支援的表單外掛。請安裝 Contact Form 7、WPForms、Fluent Forms、Ninja Forms、Formidable Forms、Forminator 或 Gravity Forms，或者黏貼其他表單的短代碼。"],"The form plugin keeps the fields, e-mails and entries; this block gives the form your look.":["欄位、郵件和提交紀錄仍由表單外掛管理；此區塊為表單套用您的外觀。"],"Form plugin":["表單外掛"],"Form shortcode":["表單短代碼"],"One shortcode only, for example [my_form id=\"3\"]. The fields get the look of the block; how well depends on the form plugin.":["僅限一個短代碼，例如 [my_form id=\"3\"]。欄位會套用區塊的外觀，效果取决於表單外掛。"],"Form":["表單"],"This plugin has no published form yet. Make one in its menu and come back.":["此外掛還沒有已發布的表單。請在外掛選單中建立表單後再回來。"],"This form plugin is not active.":["此表單外掛未啟用。"],"Fields":["欄位"],"Field style":["欄位樣式"],"Filled":["填充"],"Line under the field":["欄位下方的線條"],"One column":["一欄"],"Two columns (short fields side by side)":["兩列（短欄位並排）"],"Label size (px, 0 = as the text)":["標籤大小（px，0 = 與正文相同）"],"Corner radius":["圓角"],"Space inside the fields":["欄位內距"],"Border width":["邊框粗細"],"Space between the fields":["欄位間距"],"Width":["寬度"],"By the text":["按文字寬度"],"Corner radius (-1 = as the theme buttons)":["圓角（-1 = 與主題按鈕相同）"],"Labels and fields":["標籤和欄位"],"Field text":["欄位文字"],"Field background":["欄位背景"],"Field border":["欄位邊框"],"Active field, checkboxes":["當前欄位、核取方塊"],"Button colors":["按鈕顏色"],"Background on hover":["懸停時的背景"],"Text on hover":["懸停時的文字"],"Sent":["已發送"],"Errors":["錯誤"],"Languages":["語言"],"Shows the languages of WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress, in their order. Each link opens the same page in the other language.":["按順序顯示 WPML、Polylang 或 TranslatePress 的語言。每個連結都會以另一種語言打開同一頁面。"],"Row of links":["一行連結"],"Flag and name":["國旗和名稱"],"Flag":["國旗"],"Flag and code":["國旗和代碼"],"Code (EN, DE)":["代碼（EN、DE）"],"Flag shape":["國旗形狀"],"Rectangle":["矩形"],"Circle":["圓形"],"Hide the current language":["隱藏當前語言"],"Hide languages without a translation of the page":["隱藏沒有該頁面翻译的語言"],"WPML and Polylang: otherwise such a language links to its home page.":["WPML 和 Polylang：否則該語言會連結到它的首頁。"],"Menu opens to the":["選單展開方向"],"Right (aligned left)":["向右（左對齊）"],"Left (aligned right)":["向左（右對齊）"],"Current language and hover":["當前語言和懸停"],"Menu background":["選單背景"],"Menu text":["選單文字"],"Switch":["開關"],"Visitors choose whether the prices are shown with or without tax; every price of the store follows. Shows only when WooCommerce calculates taxes. More in Envo Blocks › Settings › Tax Switcher.":["訪客可選擇以含稅或不含稅顯示價格；商店中的每個價格都會隨之變化。僅在 WooCommerce 計算稅費時顯示。詳見「Envo Blocks › 設定 › 含稅切換」。"],"Two buttons":["兩個按鈕"],"Order of the options":["選項順序"],"With tax first":["含稅在前"],"Without tax first":["不含稅在前"],"Text for prices with tax":["含稅價格的文字"],"Empty = \"Incl. VAT\" (or \"Incl. Tax\", by the country of the store).":["留空 =「含增值稅」（或根據商店所在國家顯示「含稅」）。"],"Text for prices without tax":["不含稅價格的文字"],"Empty = \"Excl. VAT\" (or \"Excl. Tax\").":["留空 =「不含增值稅」（或「不含稅」）。"],"Show a label":["顯示標籤"],"Label":["標籤"],"Active background":["當前選項背景"],"Active text":["當前選項文字"],"Summer collection":["夏季系列"],"Light fabrics and bright colors for warm days.":["輕薄面料與明快色彩，適合溫暖的日子。"],"Shop now":["立即選購"],"Choose an image or a video":["選擇圖片或影片"],"Replace the background":["替換背景"],"Remove the background":["移除背景"],"Focal point":["焦點"],"Alternative text":["替代文字"],"Describe the image if it says something the text does not; leave it empty for a decorative background.":["如果圖片表達了文字中沒有的內容，請描述它；裝飾性背景請留空。"],"Overlay opacity (%)":["遮罩不透明度（%）"],"A darker overlay keeps light text readable on any photo. Its color is under Styles.":["較深的遮罩可讓淺色文字在任何照片上都清晰易讀。其顏色在「樣式」中設定。"],"Parallax":["視差"],"Effect while scrolling":["捲動時的效果"],"Parallax (the background moves slower)":["視差（背景移動得更慢）"],"Zoom (the background grows)":["縮放（背景逐漸放大）"],"None (a still background)":["無（靜止的背景）"],"Strength":["强度"],"Reverse (from bigger to normal)":["反向（從放大到正常）"],"Reverse (the background moves faster than the page)":["反向（背景比頁面移動得更快）"],"Also on phones":["手機上也顯示"],"Off: a still background on screens up to 781 px.":["關閉：在 781 px 及以下的螢幕上背景保持靜止。"],"The effect runs on the site; the editor shows a still background. Visitors who turned on \"reduce motion\" in their system see a still background too.":["效果在網站上運行；編輯器中顯示靜止的背景。在系統中開啟「減弱動態效果」的訪客也會看到靜止的背景。"],"Size and content":["尺寸和內容"],"Minimum height":["最小高度"],"Minimum height (% of the screen)":["最小高度（螢幕的 %）"],"Minimum height (px)":["最小高度（px）"],"Content width (px)":["內容寬度（px）"],"0 = the content width of the theme.":["0 = 主題的內容寬度。"],"Content position":["內容位置"],"Overlay":["遮罩"],"Background without an image":["無圖片時的背景"],"On this page":["本頁內容"],"Overview":["概覽"],"Details":["詳情"],"Sticking":["固定"],"The blocks stay in view inside the column or group this block is in, until its end. Put it in the shorter column of a Columns block. The editor shows it without sticking.":["這些區塊會在本區塊所在的欄或組中保持可見，直到其末尾。請把它放在分欄區塊中較短的一欄裡。編輯器中顯示為不固定。"],"Space at the top":["頂部間距"],"Below a sticky header (automatic)":["在固定頁首下方（自動）"],"From the top of the screen":["從螢幕頂部開始"],"Extra space (px)":["額外間距（px）"],"Space from the top (px)":["距頂部的距離（px）"],"Space at the bottom (px)":["底部間距（px）"],"For content taller than the screen: it floats – while scrolling down it stops this far above the bottom, while scrolling up at the top.":["內容高於螢幕時：它會浮動——向下捲動時停在距底部這麼遠的位置，向上捲動時停在頂部。"],"Sticky on":["固定於"],"Computers and tablets":["電腦和平板"],"Computers only":["僅電腦"],"Every screen, phones too":["所有螢幕，包括手機"],"Documentation":["文件"]}}}